VieNeu-TTS — Minimal personal-use fork
==========================================

This fork is a trimmed, personal-local-use derivative of the upstream
project VieNeu-TTS (v3 Turbo).

Upstream project
---------------
VieNeu-TTS by Pham Nguyen Ngoc Bao (pnnbao97).
Homepage: https://github.com/pnnbao97/VieNeu-TTS
Model weights: pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-TTS-v3-Turbo (Hugging Face)
Codec: OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano(-ONNX)
Phonemizer: sea-g2p (https://github.com/pnnbao97/sea-g2p)

Copyright of the upstream code, model weights, preset voices and audio
samples belongs to their respective owners. This fork keeps the upstream
Apache-2.0 license (see LICENSE) and retains all applicable copyright,
patent, trademark and attribution notices.

What this fork changed
----------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 Dao Manh Dung <interface.daodung@gmail.com>
Repository: https://github.com/interface-daodung/VieNeu-TTS

Kept only the preset-voice ONNX/CPU streaming path
(apps/web_stream.py + src/vieneu + src/vieneu_utils) for offline,
single-user use on a personal machine. Removed: voice cloning,
Gradio UI, Docker, fine-tuning, GPU backends, tests and related docs.

